{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9faac2ddc78503aaa1da8d64ac19ed75679ea748114d54fe2735fbbc236434ef", "ja": "（今日の仕事は無事に終了。その帰り、俺とやよいは\n劇場近くの喫茶店で、一緒に夕飯を食べた）", "zh": "（顺利结束了今天的工作后，在下班路上，\n我和弥生一起到剧场附近的咖啡厅吃了晚餐。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "263b993d9f178d5b9f742a0904d7839464015f94ed5a420b48e34bf9daa00420", "ja": "{$P$}、ごちそうさまでした。\nすっごく、おいしかったですー！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢招待！\n真的非常好吃──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "355826db765219a9eea751219f7603d6bee539c3924ef6c07f9afacfb4a44954", "ja": "どういたしまして。今日のレイニーファッション\nショーも大成功だったし、これくらいはな。", "zh": "不用客气，今天的雨日时装秀也圆满成功，\n请吃个饭是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "0119baa82bf18ed0edf3ed24745f318997dcd43b5d55d0750c503724389521d7", "ja": "雨をいーっぱい降らせてファッションショーをする\nなんて、初めてで！　とーっても楽しかったですっ！", "zh": "在人造大雨下举办的时装秀，\n这我还是头一次参加呢！真～的非常好玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "479f91812f727f552742afc63a565e54fc7f2f513742a51e892d906a719438e9", "ja": "ああ。晴れてるのに、放水車で雨を降らせて\nショーをやるのは、俺も面白い試みだと思ったよ。", "zh": "是啊，明明是晴天，却找来喷水车做出降雨效果来\n举办时装秀，我也觉得这是非常有意思的尝试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "29863f5119e5945f54cfde3d6c661133fb70506a55678edf3ccf0f0a9780829e", "ja": "そうですよねっ。もっとも～っと\nショーをやってたかったなーって！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "就是说啊，让我开始想参加\n更多更～多时装秀了呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "554875690ca78ee8c65add0135a0927d0b632983fe73226939bce1f08e8b68b3", "ja": "{$P$}、\n私、雨の日って、けっこう好きなんです。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n其实我啊，还满喜欢下雨天的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "a1820b8eb066df496977ddf1953895290d54604b16263331c89c8f7637cb64f8", "ja": "雨のザーッて音とか、水たまりをパシャッて\n踏むのとか、傘をクルクル～ってするのとか！", "zh": "像是下雨的沙沙声、踩进水滩的感觉，\n或是把伞转来转去～这些我都喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8834faa9cad5be9bd02bce0fc43130b502d0eb4c86f4ab36a49f8e4bab6fe334", "ja": "なるほど。そういえばこの前、雨の日に\n外で仕事だった時も、楽しそうだったな。", "zh": "这样啊，说起来之前下雨的时候，\n你接到要外出的工作也是很开心的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f4fde2346ddbba44772e83d656d7a59789fbbeb32e8ee88d2c131cc7bef5b1e7", "ja": "そうやって、何でも楽しめるのは\nやよいのすごい長所だと思うよ。", "zh": "像这样从任何事物当中都能找到乐趣，\n我认为正是弥生的优点呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "82db9066e34b0ded7b3cde240285fb3d979bebec2517783080a0429f0efff40a", "ja": "そうなんですか？\nありがとうございますー！", "zh": "是这样吗？\n谢谢──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "607233a271b6456b0310061fad684b5dc22e8d82d0d2cb87c009904300662c74", "ja": "ははは。さて、じゃあそろそろ劇場に戻ろうか。\n……と、あれ？　いつの間にか雨が降ってる。", "zh": "哈哈哈。那么，我们也差不多该回剧场了。\n……咦，奇怪？什么时候开始下起雨了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7916a8ea7f95edef25ed726f67fa22edcb755351e81d7ac68b5cf013afe3f55e", "ja": "困ったな……本当に降るなんて思ってなかったから、\n傘を持ってきてないぞ。", "zh": "伤脑筋……我没想到真的会下雨，\n所以没带伞出门啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "055a5c39b561ce967afc30bb5c3471130e29ed2767eff9cccd9858b2f953e043", "ja": "私も……。……あっ、私、持ってます。\n今日のショーで使った傘を、1本もらえたんでした！", "zh": "我也是……啊，我有伞！\n是今天在时装秀上用的伞，我拿了一把回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8cf8f0e058be63dc069909ec46d82a8405ccdf155e4ec1cc9acac0614e0c08de", "ja": "よかった。じゃあ、やよいだけでも劇場に\n戻れそうだな。送ってやれなくて悪いけど……。", "zh": "太好了，这样至少弥生回得了剧场。\n不好意思，不能陪你回去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "be605f6ae2c011e81e28cfa463379a3711f77e3209dcd17004ecfa9d2a2a46fe", "ja": "ええっ、{$P$}はどうするんですか？\n雨、結構強いみたいですけど……。", "zh": "咦咦！？那{$P$}要怎么办？\n这雨还挺大的耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e8309a04f096f3f691505fc36a2cb2f0ff67c173a8157d7ac5bdcb085af4c8ca", "ja": "まあまあ、大丈夫だよ。走れば5……\n10分くらいだし、劇場に戻れば、着替えもあるから。", "zh": "没事没事，别担心啦，用跑的大概五……\n大概十分钟就到了，回到剧场我也有衣服可以换。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "67d9e67fbd366986c241e665ee2c84c769cd7ccd0220ba30317cf502b2dc4cbb", "ja": "うう～、でもでも～。そんなのダメですよ～。\n……そうだ！　傘、一緒に入っていきませんか？", "zh": "唔～可是可是～不能让你这样啦～\n……对了！要不要跟我一起撑一把伞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3514f0a35b2f7140b30a38b5c4ef41c3c536c46080b20dcbfaf5f767ba680d20", "ja": "え？　でも、大丈夫か？", "zh": "咦？这样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "74bdf16b8881f5d6c42c50a17897fcfcfc1d07bbc3aa7201387d671bb626f599", "ja": "大丈夫です！　ほら、この傘、大きいですし、\nふたりでもちゃんと入れますから！", "zh": "没问题的！你看，这把伞这么大，\n可以两个人一起撑啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c41a6abfcecf19f8d63a5b9d1ed6ebe22a617c34faab0e8af0855b7db02eebfc", "ja": "やよいが濡れないように持てば大丈夫か……。\nよし、それならお言葉に甘えるとするか！", "zh": "看来我撑伞时小心别让弥生淋湿似乎就行了……\n好，那我就恭敬不如从命了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0103_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "94795c97d6098eee1a96989867a8e763884401938f261977072c1663acfb8cea", "ja": "はいっ。一緒に帰りましょーっ！\nえへへっ、雨の日ってやっぱり、大好きです！", "zh": "嗯！一起回去吧──！\n嘿嘿！下雨天果然最棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
